<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 6.944 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 6.944 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International said the following FTSE-100 stocks go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 6.944 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)    EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY			  Net  Gross   Gross</p>
<p> * Rentokil Initial			   3.58  4.48   0.373</p>
<p> * Shell Transport &amp; Trading	     22.50 28.13   5.444</p>
<p> * Tesco					  7.10  8.88   1.127</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
